{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_ttr_6_1","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_6","textTraditional":"【經】","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_ttr_6_2","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_6","textTraditional":"六年春，鄭人來渝平。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_ttr_6_3","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_6","textTraditional":"夏五月辛酉，公會齊侯盟于艾。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_ttr_6_4","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_6","textTraditional":"秋七月。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_ttr_6_5","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_6","textTraditional":"冬，宋人取長葛。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_ttr_6_6","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_6","textTraditional":"【傳】","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_ttr_6_7","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_6","textTraditional":"六年春，鄭人來渝平，更成也。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_ttr_6_8","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_6","textTraditional":"翼九宗五正頃父之子嘉父，逆晉侯于隨，納諸鄂。晉人謂之鄂侯。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_ttr_6_9","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_6","textTraditional":"夏，盟于艾，始平于齊也。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_ttr_6_10","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_6","textTraditional":"五月庚申，鄭伯侵陳，大獲。往歲，鄭伯請成于陳，陳侯不許。五父諫曰：「親仁善鄰，國之寶也。君其許鄭。」陳侯曰：「宋、衛實難，鄭何能為？」遂不許。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_ttr_6_11","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_6","textTraditional":"君子曰：「善不可失，惡不可長，其陳桓公之謂乎？長惡不悛，從自及也。雖欲救之，其將能乎？《商書》曰：『惡之易也，如火之燎于原，不可鄉邇，其猶可撲滅？』周任有言曰：『為國家者，見惡，如農夫之務去草焉，芟夷蘊崇之，絕其本根，勿使能殖，則善者信矣。』」","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_ttr_6_12","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_6","textTraditional":"秋，宋人取長葛。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_ttr_6_13","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_6","textTraditional":"冬，京師來告饑。公為之請糴於宋、衛、齊、鄭，禮也。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_ttr_6_14","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_6","textTraditional":"鄭伯如周，始朝桓王也。王不禮焉。周桓公言於王曰：「我周之東遷，晉、鄭焉依。善鄭以勸來者，猶懼不蔇，況不禮焉？鄭不來矣！」","sentenceOrder":14}],"overrides":{}}